Date: Thu, 23 Jul 2026 07:26:40 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Add ThinkingBudgetTransform unit tests for prompt-scan state
 machine

11 gtest cases covering the reverse prompt scan (last think-related
token wins, trailing prompt tokens pre-counted against the budget,
end_id -> DONE with re-arm on a newly generated <think>) plus the rest
of the state machine: budget==0 forcing including the closed-block
case, natural close before budget, think-free prompts, unlimited
budget, and the vector logits path. Test-only change.

All 11 green at cea6c5f2 on Windows/MSVC (Release, Ninja); full
tests_continuous_batching suite passes locally.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
